==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*nimet'oin}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|fi|nimi|ton|alt2=tön}}.
* {{s|ring finger}} Stems from superstition; compare {{cog|izh|nimetöin sormi}}, {{ncog|ru|безымянный палец|lit=nameless finger}}, {{ncog|sa|अनामिका|lit=nameless}}, {{ncog|zh|無名指|lit=nameless finger}}.

